  "solution": "**Explanation:**\n\nBODMAS RULE-\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/337cba09b098a129c60c88ca431dc00f7470bb1b39c1452e8d81688a7d6b6b0e.png] \n\nLet's check each option:\n\nOption 1. +, −, =, −, ×\n\nGiven equation: (130 * 4) * 21 * 485 * (28 * 2)\n\nAfter replacing the signs, we get:\n\n⇒ __**(130 + 4)**__ - 21 = 485 - __**(28 × 2)**__\n\n⇒ __134** - 21**__ = __**485 - **56__\n\n⇒ 113 ≠ 429\n\nOption 2. ÷, +, =, −, ×\n\nGiven equation: (130 * 4) * 21 * 485 * (28 * 2)\n\nAfter replacing the signs, we get:\n\n⇒ __(130 ÷ 4)__ + 21 = 485 - __(28 × 2)__\n\n⇒ __32.5 - 21__ = __485 - 56__\n\n⇒ 11.5 ≠ 429\n\nOption 3. ×, −, =, −, ÷\n\nGiven equation: (130 * 4) * 21 * 485 * (28 * 2)\n\nAfter replacing the signs, we get:\n\n⇒ __(130 × 4)__ - 21 = 485 - __(28 ÷ 2)__\n\n⇒ __520 - 21__ = __485 - 14__\n\n⇒ 499 ≠ 473\n\nOption 4. **×, −, =, +, ÷**\n\nGiven equation: (130 * 4) * 21 * 485 * (28 * 2)\n\nAfter replacing the signs, we get:\n\n⇒ __(130 × 4)__ - 21 = 485 + __(28 ÷ 2)__\n\n⇒ __520 - 21__ = __485 + 14__\n\n**​⇒ 499 = 499**\n\nHence,\" ×, −, =, +, ÷\" is the correct answer.",
